Quick start
-----------
1.  Set DATABASE_URL in your `.env` file (see `.env.example`).
2.  Call `init_db()` once at startup to create the tables.
3.  Use `get_session()` as a context manager for every transaction.

Example::

    from {{ pkg_name }}.database import init_db, get_session, create_user, get_user

    init_db()

    with get_session() as session:
        user = create_user(session, name="Alice", email="alice@example.com")
        print(user.id, user.name)
